Fri Oct 23 17:08:20 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.6.1:
  * sas_discover: show linkrate and speed info in verbose output,
    highlighted when on a tty
  * sas: handle devices whose target has no scsi_generic in sysfs
  * sysfs: always sanitize values to avoid binary output
    (seen with Dell HBA355e board names)
  * sysfs: make value sanitizing resilient to non-string input
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tag, use %{?ext_man} for man pages

